<title>USA: Todd-AO to buy video conversion company.</title>
<headline>Todd-AO to buy video conversion company.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Calif. 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Todd-AO Corp on Thursday said it planned to acquire International Video Conversions.</p>
<p>Based in Burbank, Calif., International Video specializes in video tape duplication, telecine and conversions, Todd-AO said in a statement.</p>
<p>Financial terms were undisclosed. The deal is expected to be completed in March 1997.</p>
</text>
